  "description": "🔥 IndFusion.Ember - The fusion point where real-time messages ignite and spread across any transport. Transport-agnostic real-time communication abstraction following Clean Architecture principles. Like a glowing ember spreading through systems: messages ignite (movement), propagate (tracking), and illuminate (display). Currently implemented with SignalR, but designed for universal transport fusion: WebSockets, gRPC, TCP, Azure Service Bus, AWS EventBridge, OPC-UA, and more. Perfect for dashboards, health monitoring, and real-time UI updates - universal infrastructure for all applications.",
